## ----------------------------------------------------------------------
## .gitignore para .NET / Visual Studio / VS Code / JetBrains Rider
## ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Archivos de compilación y salida ---
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
out/
publish/

# --- Visual Studio ---
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.userprefs

# --- Visual Studio Code ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

# --- JetBrains Rider ---
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# --- User-specific files / Local Settings ---
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

# --- Dependencias y Paquetes NuGet ---
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# --- Cobertura de código y Pruebas ---
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/

# --- Archivos temporales y de sistema ---
[Tt]emp/
[Tt]mp/
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Archivos de caché
*cache

# Símbolos de depuración locales (se compilarán en el pipeline cuando corresponda)
*.pdb

# Ignorar carpetas bin y obj de manera recursiva en cualquier subdirectorio
**/bin/
**/obj/